```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant AM as AlarmManager
    participant SVC as AlarmRingService
    participant NM as NotificationManager
    participant OS as Android
    participant MA as MainActivity

    Note over AM,SVC: arming
    MA->>AM: scheduleAlarmRing interval 7 with inSeconds 0
    AM->>SVC: fires the start intent
    Note over AM,SVC: the armed intent carries no interval id extra

    Note over SVC,NM: first ring
    SVC->>SVC: intervalId reads 0 from the default
    SVC->>NM: startForeground posts the alarm notification
    NM->>OS: full screen intent while locked
    OS->>MA: launches MainActivity
    MA->>MA: showAlarmRing sets showWhenLocked and turnScreenOn
    SVC->>SVC: startPlayback loops sound_timer_expired

    Note over MA,SVC: every reschedule after this
    MA->>MA: producer emits Alarm with intervalId 7 and inSeconds 0
    MA->>SVC: cancelAllAlarms stops the service unless the list matches
    Note over MA,SVC: ringing interval reads 0 so the list never matches
    SVC->>SVC: releasePlayback stops the audio
    SVC->>SVC: onDestroy clears isRunning
    MA->>AM: arms the same alarm at now
    AM->>SVC: fires the start intent again
    SVC->>NM: startForeground posts the notification again
    NM->>OS: full screen intent again
    OS->>MA: clears the task and makes a new activity
    SVC->>SVC: startPlayback starts the audio again
```
